{"id":71201,"date":"2026-10-28T09:34:25","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:34:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71201"},"modified":"2026-10-28T10:38:47","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:38:47","slug":"trail-do-sino-e-da-castanha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-sino-e-da-castanha\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Sino e da Castanha 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Sino e da Castanha 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail do Sino e da Castanha 2026<\/strong> (6\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">8 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, com partidas e chegadas no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Largo do Terreiro, em Granja Nova<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Tarouca<\/strong> (distrito de Viseu). Numa \u00e9poca em que os soutos e a castanha assumem protagonismo na paisagem outonal do Vale do Varosa, a prova re\u00fane at\u00e9 800 participantes entre vertentes competitivas de trail running e caminhadas conv\u00edvio. Planeia os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre mais eventos no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Provas de Trail em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo desenvolve-se pelos trilhos florestais, caminhos rurais e percursos pedestres envolventes \u00e0s localidades de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Granja Nova, Vila Ch\u00e3 da Beira e Formilo<\/strong>, integrando quatro dist\u00e2ncias com hor\u00e1rios desfasados: o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trail M\u00e9dio de 17 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Trail de 11 km<\/strong> e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 11 km<\/strong> (ambos com partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:05<\/strong>) e a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Caminhada de 6 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:10<\/strong>). Os percursos de trail destinam-se a atletas com idade m\u00ednima de 16 anos, enquanto as duas caminhadas est\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m abertas a menores acompanhados por um adulto respons\u00e1vel.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Vale Varosa<\/strong>, pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal de Tarouca<\/strong> e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Granja Nova e Vila Ch\u00e3 da Beira<\/strong>, o evento assegura cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip no dorsal, postos de controlo e abastecimento s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido, pr\u00e9mio Finisher a todos os participantes, almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio \u00e0s 13:00 e cerim\u00f3nia de entrega de pr\u00e9mios \u00e0s 13:30.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">La